WEBVTT

00:25:00.746 --> 00:25:06.246
even though they were 10 or 15 or even 20
years out of those initial experiences,

00:25:06.538 --> 00:25:10.288
they were more satisfied with their
current job than people who graduated in

00:25:10.288 --> 00:25:11.538
good economic times.

00:25:12.288 --> 00:25:15.621
At some of the sounds like good news,
provided we can get reemployed,

00:25:15.871 --> 00:25:19.996
it seems like your data would suggest
we're going to be happier with our jobs

00:25:19.996 --> 00:25:21.579
and more likely to appreciate them.

00:25:21.704 --> 00:25:26.163
Yeah, this is the first surprise people
who start their careers in

00:25:26.163 --> 00:25:29.413
a recession may feel less entitled
to the perfect job

00:25:29.663 --> 00:25:31.496
and more grateful to be employed.